description.en:
[gold]Exhaust[/gold] all [gold]Encoded[/gold] cards.
Gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} and draw a card for each card [gold]Exhausted[/gold].{InCombat:cond:
(Gain {Dev:energyIcons()} and draw {Dev:plural:a card|{} cards})|}

description.zh:
[gold]消耗[/gold]所有[gold]已编码[/gold]的牌。
每[gold]消耗[/gold]一张，获得{energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}并抽1张牌。{InCombat:cond:
（获得{Dev:energyIcons()}并抽{Dev:diff()}张牌）|}

获得{RitualPower:diff()}层[gold]仪式[/gold]。{IfUpgraded:show:
获得{StrengthPower:diff()}点[gold]力量[/gold]。|}
将2张[gold]虚空[/gold]加入你的[gold]弃牌堆[/gold]。

description.en:
获得{Block:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]。
造成你当前[gold]格挡[/gold]值的伤害。{InCombat:
（造成{CalculatedDamage:diff()}点伤害）|}

description.zh:
获得{Block:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]。
造成你当前[gold]格挡[/gold]值的伤害。{InCombat:
（造成{CalculatedDamage:diff()}点伤害）|}

description.en:
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to double your [gold]Counter[/gold].
Lose all of your [gold]Counter[/gold].{InCombat:cond:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}

description.zh:
获得两倍于你的[gold]反击[/gold]层数的[gold]格挡[/gold]。
失去所有[gold]反击[/gold]。{InCombat:cond:
(获得{CalculatedBlock:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold])|}

description.en:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Counter[/gold] to ALL enemies. 
If not in [gold]Defensive[/gold], lose half of your [gold]Counter[/gold].{InCombat:cond:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

description.zh:
对所有敌人造成等同于你的[gold]反击[/gold]层数的伤害。
如果不处于[gold]防守[/gold]，失去一半的[gold]反击[/gold]层数。{InCombat:cond:
（造成{CalculatedDamage:diff()}点伤害）|}

description.en:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Block[/gold] twice.
If not in [gold]Defensive[/gold], don't gain [gold]Block[/gold] from cards next turn.{InCombat:cond:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage twice)|}

description.zh:
造成等同于你[gold]格挡[/gold]的伤害两次。
如果不处于[gold]防守[/gold]，下个回合无法从卡牌中获得[gold]格挡[/gold]。{InCombat:
（造成{CalculatedDamage:diff()}点伤害两次）|}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
For each [gold]Dead On[/gold] effect triggered this turn, deal it again to a random enemy.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {CalculatedHits:diff()} additional {CalculatedHits:plural:time|times})|}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
本回合每触发过一次[gold]精准[/gold]，再攻击一次随机敌人。{InCombat:cond:
（额外命中{CalculatedHits:diff()}次）|}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
[gold]Ignite[/gold] the current Ghostflame.{IfUpgraded:show:
You may choose to [gold]Advance[/gold] or [gold]Retract[/gold].|}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
[gold]点燃[/gold]当前鬼火。{IfUpgraded:show:
选择[gold]步进[/gold]或[gold]回退[/gold]。|}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy. 
Repeat for each card [gold]Exhausted[/gold] last turn.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|}

Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy for each Slime.
[gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|}

description.zh:
你每有一只史莱姆，就对随机敌人造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
[gold]吸收[/gold]所有史莱姆。{InCombat:cond:
（命中{Repeat:diff()}次）|}

给予{VulnerablePower:diff()}层[gold]易伤[/gold]。
给予{GoopPower:diff()}层[gold]黏液[/gold]。{IfUpgraded:show:
抽1张牌。|}

description.en:
[gold]Absorb[/gold] ALL Slimes.
[gold]Split[/gold] into a random [gold]Specialist[/gold] for each.{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]Command[/gold] them{Command:plural:| {Command:diff()} times}.}

description.zh:
[gold]吸收[/gold]所有史莱姆。
每吸收一只，[gold]分裂[/gold]一个随机的[gold]专家[/gold]史莱姆。{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]命令[/gold]所有史莱姆{Command:plural:|{Command:diff()}次}。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Gain a [gold]Lick[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw a card.|}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
获得一张[gold]舔舐[/gold]。{IfUpgraded:show:
抽1张牌。|}

description.en:
Gain {PotencyPower:diff()} [gold]Potency[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]Command[/gold] twice.|}
In {OverexertPower:diff()} turns from now, [gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.

description.zh:
获得{PotencyPower:diff()}点[gold]潜能[/gold]。{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]命令[/gold]两次。|}
{OverexertPower:diff()}回合后，[gold]吸收[/gold]所有史莱姆。

description.en:
Apply {GoopPower:diff()} [gold]Goop[/gold].
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw a card.|}

description.zh:
给予{GoopPower:diff()}层[gold]黏液[/gold]。
获得{Block:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]。{IfUpgraded:show:
抽1张牌。|}

description.en:
Gain {CalculationExtra:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold] and {BlurExtra:diff()} [gold]Blur[/gold] for each Slime.
[gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.{InCombat:cond:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock} [gold]Block[/gold] and {Blur} [gold]Blur[/gold])|}

description.zh:
你每有一只史莱姆，就获得{CalculationExtra:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]和{BlurExtra:diff()}层[gold]残影[/gold]。
[gold]吸收[/gold]所有史莱姆。{InCombat:cond:
(获得{CalculatedBlock}点[gold]格挡[/gold]和{Blur}层[gold]残影[/gold])|}

description.en:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].
Draw {Cards:diff()} random [gold]Offclass[/gold] {Cards:plural:card|cards}.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common.}

description.zh:
获得{Block:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]。
将[gold]抽牌堆[/gold]中的{Cards:diff()}张随机[gold]异色[/gold]牌放入你的[gold]手牌[/gold]。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：普通牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Enemy takes {SneckoConstrictPower:diff()} damage at the end of each of its turns.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Rare Attack.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
目标敌人在每回合结束时受到{SneckoConstrictPower:diff()}点伤害。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：稀有攻击牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage for each [gold]Offclass[/gold] card played this turn.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

description.zh:
本回合此前你每打出过一张[gold]异色[/gold]牌，就造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。{InCombat:cond:
（命中{Repeat:diff()}次）|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：罕见牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
[gold]Muddle[/gold] a card.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: 3+ cost.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
[gold]混淆[/gold]一张牌。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：耗能大于等于3的牌。}

description.en:
Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold],
increased by {CalculationExtra:diff()} for each [gold]Offclass[/gold] card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

description.zh:
获得{CalculatedBlock:diff()}点[gold]格挡[/gold]。
你的[gold]手牌[/gold]中每有一张[gold]异色[/gold]牌，额外获得{CalculationExtra:diff()}点。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：罕见牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Repeat for each unique Strike played this combat.
{InCombat:cond:(Hits {UniqueStrikesPlayed:diff()} {UniqueStrikesPlayed:plural:time|times})|[gold]Gift[/gold]: Strike.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
本场战斗此前每打出过一种打击牌，再造成一次。
{InCombat:cond:（命中{UniqueStrikesPlayed:diff()}次）|[gold]赠礼[/gold]：打击牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
[gold]Overflow[/gold]: Deal {OverflowDamage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies for each other card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {OverflowRepeat:diff()} {OverflowRepeat:plural:time|times})|}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
[gold]溢出[/gold]：你[gold]手牌[/gold]中每有一张其他的牌，对所有敌人造成{OverflowDamage:diff()}点伤害。{InCombat:cond:
（命中{OverflowRepeat:diff()}次）|}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
If the target has at least {Debuffs:diff()} debuffs, draw {Cards:diff()} cards.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Debuff.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
如果目标敌人至少有{Debuffs:diff()}种负面效果，抽{Cards:diff()}张牌。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：负面状态牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Apply {VenomPower:diff()} [gold]Venom[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common Debuff.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
给予{VenomPower:diff()}层[gold]剧毒[/gold]。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：普通负面状态牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
If you played an [gold]Offclass[/gold] card this turn, deal {Damage:diff()} damage again.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
如果你本回合此前打出过[gold]异色[/gold]牌，再造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：普通牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Reduce the cost of [gold]Offclass[/gold] cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold] by {Energy:energyIcons()} this turn.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
本回合你[gold]手牌[/gold]中[gold]异色[/gold]牌的耗能降低{Energy:energyIcons()}。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：罕见牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Gain a [gold]Shiv{IfUpgraded:show:+|}[/gold] for each unique color in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

description.zh:
造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
你的[gold]手牌[/gold]中每有一种卡牌颜色，获得一张[gold]小刀{IfUpgraded:show:+|}[/gold]。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：罕见牌。}

description.en:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
[gold]Upgrade[/gold] all [gold]Offclass[/gold] cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common.}

description.zh:
对所有敌人造成{Damage:diff()}点伤害。
[gold]升级[/gold]你[gold]手牌[/gold]中的所有[gold]异色[/gold]牌。{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]赠礼[/gold]：普通牌。}
